    "title": "New York Giants mailbag: It's all quarterback all the time - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ed Valentine ,\n21 hours ago The mail’s here! Questions, answers about the Giants. Ed Helinski asks: What’s the Giants Plan C if Jameis Winston isn’t the answer for whatever reason?. Ed says: Ed, how many times actually have a realistic Plan C at quarterback? The reality is that if you are down to your third quarterback, things are not going to go well. Read full article",
